        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>Takane</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Sorry to keep you waiting. I
came after all.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hey, walking side by side
like this... it's been a
while, hasn't it？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Maybe... Sorry.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>No, it's okay. As long as
you'll be with me a lot from
now on, okay？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hah...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What's wrong？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I was remembering when we
went to Atami.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Ah, Atami...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I still think about it a
lot. It's our wonderful
memory...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I see. Yeah.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>The day I got to be with you
the longest... I can't
forget it.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>....</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Eh...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Um... I feel like you've
been staring at me.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Have I？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>You have... Geez, what's
gotten into you？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Have I... gotten a little
prettier？ ...Just kidding.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hmm...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Sorry, saying something
weird... Geez, don't look at
me with such sparkling
eyes？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh, do I have eyes like
that？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>You do. Let me see your
face？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Look at me straight on.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Don't be so far away. Come
closer？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Um, that's too close. It's
okay, I can see you fine...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yes... I can see you well.
Now... smile？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Smile？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yes, a nice smile... my
favorite smile.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What's wrong, embarrassed？
That's okay, then.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...What's wrong？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>It just got kind of quiet...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh？ Um...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Well...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲高嶺＊＊▲...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>For now, will you let this
be enough？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Aww？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>It's okay, let's make
more... memories from now
on？</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
